                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.24.1"&gt;3.24.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixes the SSI artifact publishing, which were not published in 3.24.0&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Misc&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix Windows SSI release (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3313677852" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7379" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7379/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7379"&gt;#7379&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/compare/v3.24.0...v3.24.1"&gt;Changes since 3.24.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.24.0"&gt;3.24.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Logs injection for connecting logs with traces is enabled by default. To disable, set &lt;code&gt;DD_LOGS_INJECTION=0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Add support for latest S3 and MSTest packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AAP] Add resource name to the collected endpoints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[DSM] Flush DSM stats on Lambda Stop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refactor the profiling configuration reading (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3277281185" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7303" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7303/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7303"&gt;#7303&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minor &lt;code&gt;IConfigurationSource&lt;/code&gt; clean up (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3284567118" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7327" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7327/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7327"&gt;#7327&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;chore: clean up baggage span tags implementation (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3290267173" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7335" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7335/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7335"&gt;#7335&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update default value of DD_LOGS_INJECTION to true (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3290487373" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7336" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7336/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7336"&gt;#7336&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix broken S3 integration (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3303254990" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7368" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7368/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7368"&gt;#7368&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;CI Visibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Support for MSTest v3.10 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3293023076" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7343" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7343/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7343"&gt;#7343&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ASM&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AAP] Add resource name to the collected endpoints (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3281201035" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7317" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7317/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7317"&gt;#7317&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AAP] Add latest supported waf capabilities to RC (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3288707098" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7332" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7332/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7332"&gt;#7332&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AAP] Added WAF metrics. Reorganized other metrics to match RFC (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3299503865" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7356" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7356/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7356"&gt;#7356&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AAP] Update WAF ruleset to v1.15.0 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3288637651" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7331" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7331/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7331"&gt;#7331&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Debugger&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Dynamic Instrumentation] DEBUG-3514 Refactor debugger code (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3278440705" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7304" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7304/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7304"&gt;#7304&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Removes exception throwing during shutdown of dynamic instrumentation (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3309746992" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7375" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7375/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7375"&gt;#7375&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Serverless&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DSMS-90: Flush DSM stats on Lambda Stop (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3115081216" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7054" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7054/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7054"&gt;#7054&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Data Streams Monitoring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do not inject DSM legacy headers by default in "default enabled" mode (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3297042481" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7351" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7351/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7351"&gt;#7351&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Build / Test&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update xunit to latest, fix analyzer warnings, and update analyzer tests (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3263379025" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7280" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7280/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7280"&gt;#7280&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Send Warm-up request in iisexpress integration tests (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3283494242" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7321" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7321/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7321"&gt;#7321&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update CODEOWNERS with SDK capabilities team as owners (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3284625648" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7328" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7328/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7328"&gt;#7328&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre pull aerospike image (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3288844444" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7333" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7333/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7333"&gt;#7333&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove CMake warning: jobserver unavailable: using -j1. Add `+' to parent make rule. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3289855473" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7334" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7334/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7334"&gt;#7334&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix typo in &lt;code&gt;create_draft_release&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3292095823" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7338" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7338/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7338"&gt;#7338&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix the signing of the fleet installer exe (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3292898702" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7341" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7341/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7341"&gt;#7341&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elaborate on Run failed description (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3293495271" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7344" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7344/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7344"&gt;#7344&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work around flake in the Couchbase 3 integration tests (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3299649952" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7357" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7357/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7357"&gt;#7357&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Try to fix flake by using unique keys in StackExchange sample tests (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3300220893" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7359" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7359/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7359"&gt;#7359&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mark the OTLP metrics test as &lt;code&gt;[Flaky]&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3303536684" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7369" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7369/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7369"&gt;#7369&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix more flake in the IIS fleet smoke tests (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3304720649" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7372" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7372/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7372"&gt;#7372&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Don't test Aerospike.Client 8.1.0 on .NET 6 or 7 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3296467164" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7349" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7349/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7349"&gt;#7349&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Miscellaneous&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cache response in order to avoid unnecessary deserializations (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3283442634" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7320" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7320/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7320"&gt;#7320&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add Stats on EnqueueRequestRejitForLoadedModules (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3292559894" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7340" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7340/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7340"&gt;#7340&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Include &lt;code&gt;telemetry_forwarder.exe&lt;/code&gt; in the Windows SSI OCI images (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3292915721" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7342" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7342/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7342"&gt;#7342&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Update the configuration key for controlling managed activation (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3296967467" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7350" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7350/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7350"&gt;#7350&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Update libdatadog to 20.0.0 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3300134648" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7358" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7358/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7358"&gt;#7358&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/compare/v3.23.0...v3.24.0"&gt;Changes since 3.23.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
